/// known-gap: interp actions cannot be kept in a list and called later
/// Each pass of a loop binds its name afresh: actions made in different
/// passes each keep their own pass's value, while sharing an outer variable.
act make()
    fs | []
    seen | 0
    repeat [1, 2, 3] as x
        act show()
            seen |= seen + 1
            return x * 10 + seen
        xx
        :put_last!(fs, show)
    xx
    return fs
xx
repeat make() as shower
    say(shower())
xx
